{"curationManifestSha256":"8deda35e2cb9b2aae68a6d4e2614684605ec85d50bf2ff9dddd19f7e4588283b","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1539","main":{"annotations":[],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"外国文学作品反映了不同地区、国家和民族不同时期的社会风貌，展示了多种多样的文化现象，表现了人类广阔而丰富的心灵世界。阅读外国文学作品，可以开阔我们的视野，培养开放的文化心态，提升人文素养。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"本单元学习外国戏剧和诗歌。《玩偶之家》是被誉为“现代戏剧之父”的易卜生的名作，作品表现的妇女解放、个性解放、社会解放的鲜明立场，及其所开创的“社会问题剧”样式，都有着世界性的影响；四首外国诗歌，风格多样，各臻其美，让我们领略诗歌世界的丰富多彩。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"学习本单元，要理解作品的内涵，领会多样的文化观念，尝试探讨作品所反映的社会文化差异，感受人类精神世界的丰富。要着重把握戏剧的矛盾冲突，体会对话在推动情节、塑造形象、揭示主题等方面的作用；要通过诵读感受诗歌的氛围，体会意象和隐喻，把握诗歌语言和情感的内在节奏，体味诗歌意蕴。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e5%9b%9b%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83?","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e5%9b%9b%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83?","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e5%9b%9b%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83?","title":null}],"media":[{"alt":"","bytes":60837,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/c/c9cd7d8a3de2f7527aa5b720e1ac69acb20e894c.jpeg","height":1146,"id":"media-abaf0fc86f4633961453","mediaType":"image/jpeg","nativeDisposition":"verified-in-app","receiptCollectedAt":"2026-07-30T01:10:43.464Z","receiptRequired":true,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-course-source-use-2026-07-29","sha256":"bee917cd2c2bdfaa8fcb417c0a11bcd4090803008922b219734754c0e5035e4a","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/c/c9cd7d8a3de2f7527aa5b720e1ac69acb20e894c.jpeg","webDisposition":"source-url","width":807}],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":10282,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"0319bd9f7623eb57ee396cafc0343cb6c4dc51dce258109a19edbdddd91be71c","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-08-09.1","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/c/c9cd7d8a3de2f7527aa5b7